# Environment-specific config never belongs in an image layer - appsettings.Docker.json holds a
# real signing key and is mounted at runtime by docker-compose.yml instead. appsettings.json ships
# its keys blank, so the image itself carries no secret.
**/appsettings.Docker.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
